{"tool_name":"nnv","contents":["oeb","biotools"],"fetched_metadata":{"biotools":{"id":"nnv","home":"https://github.com/verivital/nnv/","summary":"The Neural Network Verification Tool for Deep Neural Networks and Learning-Enabled Cyber-Physical Systems.\n\nThis paper presents the Neural Network Verification (NNV) software tool, a set-based verification framework for deep neural networks (DNNs) and learning-enabled cyber-physical systems (CPS). The crux of NNV is a collection of reachability algorithms that make use of a variety of set representations, such as polyhedra, star sets, zonotopes, and abstract-domain representations. NNV supports both exact (sound and complete) and over-approximate (sound) reachability algorithms for verifying safety and robustness properties of feed-forward neural networks (FFNNs) with various activation functions. F","addition_date":"2021-01-18T10:03:30Z","last_update_date":"2024-11-24T20:40:03.286212Z","tool_type":["Command-line tool"],"biotools_curie":"biotools:nnv","credit":[{"email":"taylor.johnson@vanderbilt.edu","name":"Taylor T. Johnson","typeEntity":"Person"}],"edit_permission":{"type":"private"},"function":[{"operation":[{"term":"Network analysis","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_3927"}]}],"name":"NNV","owner":"Niclaskn","publication":[{"pmcid":"PMC7363192"}],"topic":[{"term":"Imaging","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_3382"},{"term":"Machine learning","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_3474"},{"term":"Plant biology","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_0780"}]},"oeb":{"metrics":[{"@id":"https://openebench.bsc.es/monitor/metrics/biotools:nnv/cmd/github.com","@license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/","@nmsp":"biotools","@type":"metrics","deprecated":true,"distribution":{"binaries":{"freeness":null,"registration":null},"packages":null,"source_packages":true,"sourcecode":{"free":true,"interpreted":true,"license":false,"public":true,"readme":true,"repository":{"anonymous":true,"online":true}}},"project":{